  "goodToKnow": "Die Sonde is a probe: die Raumsonde (space probe), eine Messsonde, and in medicine a tube or catheter: die Magensonde (feeding tube). The verb sondieren means to sound out or explore. In German politics, Sondierungsgespräche (exploratory talks) come before formal coalition negotiations (Koalitionsverhandlungen) after every federal election. Plural: die Sonden."
